    <description>US-30: a returning or high-profile walk-in is saved by whoever entered it, then (straight after the save) passed to the Showroom Manager. The person who entered it gets a bell message saying so, and the manager is told the client is theirs.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_CreatorBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.FirstName} &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp; {!$Record.LastName} &amp; &quot; is a returning or high-profile client, so they have been passed to the Showroom Manager (&quot; &amp; {!Get_Showroom_Manager.Name} &amp; &quot;). Your details were saved.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>f_ManagerBody</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Record.FirstName} &amp; &quot; &quot; &amp; {!$Record.LastName} &amp; &quot; (returning or high-profile) was entered by &quot; &amp; {!$Record.CreatedBy.Name} &amp; &quot; and is now yours.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
